severity and clinical risk and\nshould be integrated with clinical judgement to guide diagnostic formulation and treatment\nplanning.\nPlots demonstrating the subscale percentiles are presented upon first administration.\nLongitudinal plots are displayed for both the subscale percentiles and the Total Internalising\npercentile upon multiple administrations to enable tracking of symptoms over time.",
